#4601
warlord zanzen warrior man~
Warlord Zanzen~
A huge man in heavy plate armor of eastern design orders his troops about.
~
The way the soldiers treat this man marks him as the supreme Warlord over this
army.  He stands at least twice as tall as any other man, and the armor he
wears looks to be crafted from the bones of his enemies.  His cold stare locks
on you, and he whips his blade from the scabbard on his hip.
~
4194403 308283520&320 -1000 C
65 0 0 8d1+0 0d0+0
0 0
112 112 1
13 13 13 13 13 13 13
0 0 0 0 0
0 12 0 0 1835007 1 0
50 50 2031 3153920 2097152 0 67110752 4
> hitprcnt_prog 10~
cackle
if rand(7)
  say I will not fall so easily!
  else
  if rand(13)
     say Me and my men shall slay you!!
     else
     if rand(14)
        say I see more of your blood than mine!
        else
        if rand(17)
           say My sword shall consume your soul!
           else
           if rand(20)
              say Fear my wrath!
              else
              if rand(25)
                 say KHAAAAAAAAAAN!
                 else
                 if rand(33)
                    say I shall feast on your flesh tonight!
                    else
                    if rand(50)
                       say First you shall die, then your land!
                    endif
                 endif
              endif
           endif
        endif
     endif
   endif
endif~
> death_prog 100~
rinvoke artifact
say You may of defeated me here, but my spirit will be revived!
cackle
~
