#4614
The Field Of Combat~
The path opens all of a sudden into a large sandy clearing.  Warriors,
fighting to the death, stretch out as far as the eye can see in all
directions.  Broken weapons and dead and wounded lie about the ground, making
movement slow and difficult.  The howls and screams of bloody war fill the
air.
~
